<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch cocoa imports down in first half 1996.</title>
<headline>Dutch cocoa imports down in first half 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch imports of cooca beans fell three percent in the first six months of 1996 compared with 1995, according to figures issued by the Central Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>It gave the following import and export data, in tonnes.</p>
<p>			 IMPORTS			    EXPORTS</p>
<p>		  Jan-Jun 96   Jan-Jun 95   Jan-Jun 96   Jan-Jun 95</p>
<p> Cocoa beans	207,235    213,371	24,227	 29,525</p>
<p> Cocoa butter	10,988     14,245	67,926	 60,404</p>
<p> Cocoa powder	 3,645	5,259	71,445	 64,078</p>
<p>--Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 570 8500</p>
</text>
